    "title": "YMCA of Central Texas secures funding for new location in Brazos Valley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago COLLEGE STATION, Texas — The YMCA of Central Texas has announced it has secured the funding to create a new location in the Brazos Valley region. According to the YMCA, the Brazos Valley Founders Committee raised $300,000 following community support, which was then matched by the YMCA of Central Texas, securing the $600,000 in funding for the new location. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
